# Files `gcloud builds submit` uploads for `./yessir.sh vertex build-image`.
# Ignore everything by default; only upload what `cloud/vertex/Dockerfile` needs
# (the same files `.dockerignore` lets into the Docker build context).
*
!/.dockerignore
!/pyproject.toml
!/uv.lock
!/cloud/
!/cloud/vertex/
!/cloud/vertex/Dockerfile
!/cloud/vertex/entrypoint.sh
